    "latency_scope": "latency statistics cover only expected-trigger hits on episodes with a recorded onset; cross-firing timings are in the per-episode first_detection map instead",
    "onset_step": "zero-based index of the first event at which the fixture generator intentionally introduces the labeled failure condition; null when the generator cannot derive one",
    "tn": "one-vs-rest: the episode does not expect this trigger and the trigger does not fire; TP+FP+TN+FN equals the episode count"
